      "description": "* WHAT...For the Extreme Heat Warning, dangerously hot conditions\nwith high temperatures in the upper 90s to 103 and warm nights with\nlow temperatures in the lower to mid 70s expected. For the Wind\nAdvisory, east winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts to 45 mph expected.\n\n* WHERE...San Bernardino and Riverside County Valleys-The Inland\nEmpire.\n\n* WHEN...For the Extreme Heat Warning, until 8 PM PDT Thursday. For\nthe Wind Advisory, until 6 PM PDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result. Heat\nrelated illnesses increase significantly during extreme heat\nevents.",
